message: "If you use this reproducibility package, please cite the repository version and the associated article when available."
title: "An FBA-Guided Multi-Agent Decision-Support System for Structuring Teacher Reports in Chinese Schools: Reproducibility Package"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Yummy-Juice"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-18
