  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  This repository contains anonymous rating data, analysis and validation code,
  generated aggregate results and figures, public metadata, and a sanitized
  documentation blueprint for an FBA-guided multi-agent decision-support
  prototype. The evidence concerns teacher perceptions and expert ratings and
  does not establish diagnostic accuracy, intervention effects, student
  outcomes, or autonomous professional decision making.
